## FoulFox network management — allow the api-server (running as foulfox) to
## drive nmcli for wifi connect/disconnect/forget without a password prompt.
## Read-only nmcli calls (status, scan) don't need polkit or sudo; only the
## state-change operations (connect, forget) go through this rule.
foulfox ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: /usr/bin/nmcli device wifi connect *, /usr/bin/nmcli connection delete id *
